flowchart LR
  Task[Define task and app version] --> Criteria[Set hard gates and soft thresholds]
  Criteria --> Dataset[Create or upload golden dataset]
  Dataset --> Approval[Review and approve items]
  Approval --> Run[Run app on dataset]
  Run --> Trace[Capture output and available trace fields]
  Trace --> Score[Score with rules and configured judges]
  Score --> Verdict{Decision engine}
  Verdict -->|GO| Ready[Review readiness report]
  Verdict -->|REVIEW / NO_GO| Improve[Improve prompt, app, or criteria]
  Improve --> Run
  Ready --> Baseline[Approve baseline]
  Baseline --> Candidate[Evaluate changed version on same suite]
  Candidate --> Regress[Compare paired results]
  Regress -->|PASS / WARN / BLOCK| Improve
